      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for this. can you expand on the section about \"external interference\" and \"security risks\" during transit? i need specifically what the ground staff or security teams should do if they suspect someone has tried to tamper with a shipment or if a container seal is found to be compromised at a remote transit hub. what are the standard industry steps for verifying if the product is still safe or if we have to quarantine it immediately?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
